I do not want to disgcourage you to learn Lojban, but doesn't it matter
also that if you expess your thouhts in Lojban they will have a very
small (AFAIK) audience?

If you'd want your thoughts to be able to reach some audience maybe
expressing them in your native language is easier. Maybe it hepls to
read books which talk about these matters. These could be philosophical
or spiritual.

That being said, you should still learn Lojban of course, but with a
more general motivation, not for this one purpose.

